# extlinux.conf — u-boot distro-boot config for Libre Computer Le/La Frite
# (Amlogic GXL). u-boot (libretech-ac / libretech-cc) scans the first partition
# for /extlinux/extlinux.conf and boots the entry below. This REPLACES the RPi5
# config.txt/cmdline.txt model entirely (no raspberrypi-firmware on this board).
#
# Variables substituted at build time (render_template in build-frite-stage4.sh):
#   @@FRITE_KERNEL_IMG@@   Kernel image filename in /boot (e.g. Image)
#   @@FRITE_DTB@@          Board DTB path under /dtb (e.g.
#                          amlogic/meson-gxl-s805x-libretech-ac.dtb)
#   @@FRITE_INITRD_LINE@@  INITRD line (live image) or a comment (installer/disk)
#   @@BRAND_TITLE@@        Menu label brand
#
# IMPORTANT (La Frite, kernel >= 5.8): boot the DTB that ships WITH THE KERNEL
# (copied to /boot/dtb by the builder), NOT the DTB embedded in u-boot — the USB
# controller nodes changed and the in-u-boot DTB is stale. extlinux's FDT line
# below points at the kernel's own DTB for exactly this reason.

DEFAULT frite
TIMEOUT 20
MENU TITLE @@BRAND_TITLE@@ — Libre Computer Frite

LABEL frite
    MENU LABEL @@BRAND_TITLE@@ light desktop
    LINUX /@@FRITE_KERNEL_IMG@@
    FDT /dtb/@@FRITE_DTB@@
@@FRITE_INITRD_LINE@@
    APPEND @@FRITE_APPEND@@
